 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## API keys and audit (schema 3)
+
+`apiKeys` holds `{ key, name, role }` records. Roles are `viewer`, `cook`,
+and `manager`. Seed data has one demonstration key per role. Migration from
+schema 2 preserves existing data and initializes missing `apiKeys` and
+`audit` arrays empty; provision keys in migrated files before using the API.
+
+`audit` is an append-only array of `{ time, name, method, path, status }`
+records for HTTP requests that save data. The record and data change are
+saved together. The API lists entries in reverse insertion order.
